# Vibe engineering Effect apps

Michael says an agent should learn a fast-moving library from its source repository. Stale model knowledge and giant prompts are less reliable. [08:51](https://youtu.be/Wmp2Tku2PrI?t=531) [12:59](https://youtu.be/Wmp2Tku2PrI?t=779)

He describes repository feedback from diagnostics, tests, lint rules, saved patterns, and short-lived contexts. He recommends choosing patterns for the project and model. [30:30](https://youtu.be/Wmp2Tku2PrI?t=1830) [38:15](https://youtu.be/Wmp2Tku2PrI?t=2295) [58:08](https://youtu.be/Wmp2Tku2PrI?t=3488)
